    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Common (Requires Attunement by a Spellcaster)</em></p><p>Engraved with eldritch runes, this 1-inch-wide ruby lets you use a Simple or Martial weapon as a Spellcasting Focus for your spells. For this to work, you must attach the ruby to the weapon by pressing it against the weapon for at least 10 minutes. After that, the ruby can’t be removed unless you detach it as a Magic action, the weapon is destroyed, or your Attunement to the ruby ends.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-ljeM87R0KvCEdEaK\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>L’activité <em>Attach to a Weapon</em> enchante l’arme choisie, qui devient un focaliseur (propriété <em>Focus</em>) sans changer de nom, de rareté ni de prix. Quand le rubis est détaché, ou que l’harmonisation prend fin, supprimez l’enchantement de l’arme.</p></section>",
